# Build contexts are the repo root (core-api, ai-engine), services/admin-console and services/chat.
# Env files never go into an image. .env holds real secrets; .env.example is
# only the template it is copied from, never read as defaults. Containers get
# every setting from compose, as environment variables.
**/.env
**/.env.*

**/.venv
**/node_modules
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
